{"title":"아찔한 남사친 [19세 완전판]","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=hShkq/dJMcacjYm5q/ya6zfYArc0VqSrYxNmqR41&filename=th3","synopsis":"“우리 6개월만 연애할래?”아버지의 지속적인 선 강요에 지친 채윤. 6개월 후에 해외 연수를 갈 계획을 세우며 소꿉친구 태산에게 계약 연애를 제안한다.태산은 눈을 반짝이는 채윤을 바라보며 의미심장한 미소를 짓곤 말했다.“근데 난 애인이랑 하고 싶은 게 많은데……. 네가 감당할 수 있을까?”“당연하지! 뭐든 말만 해.”“그래. 6개월, 네 애인을 해 주는 대신 애인으로서 할 수 있는 모든 걸 다 할 거야.채윤이 가족 같은 남사친, 태산의 시한부 애인이 된 순간이었다.ⓒ정해진,삽살(원작:차수인)/메타툰","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-31","rank":21,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-01","rank":39,"change":{"type":"down","amount":18}},{"date":"2026-09-02","rank":35,"change":{"type":"up","amount":4}},{"date":"2026-09-03","rank":54,"change":{"type":"down","amount":19}},{"date":"2026-09-04","rank":64,"change":{"type":"down","amount":10}},{"date":"2026-09-05","rank":99,"change":{"type":"down","amount":35}},{"date":"2026-09-06","rank":118,"change":{"type":"down","amount":19}},{"date":"2026-09-07","rank":118,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-08","rank":130,"change":{"type":"down","amount":12}},{"date":"2026-09-09","rank":76,"change":{"type":"up","amount":54}},{"date":"2026-09-10","rank":110,"change":{"type":"down","amount":34}},{"date":"2026-09-11","rank":142,"change":{"type":"down","amount":32}},{"date":"2026-09-12","rank":170,"change":{"type":"down","amount":28}},{"date":"2026-09-13","rank":169,"change":{"type":"up","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-09-14","rank":192,"change":{"type":"down","amount":23}},{"date":"2026-09-15","rank":150,"change":{"type":"up","amount":42}},{"date":"2026-09-16","rank":90,"change":{"type":"up","amount":60}},{"date":"2026-09-17","rank":139,"change":{"type":"down","amount":49}},{"date":"2026-09-18","rank":194,"change":{"type":"down","amount":55}},{"date":"2026-09-19","rank":203,"change":{"type":"down","amount":9}},{"date":"2026-09-20","rank":237,"change":{"type":"down","amount":34}},{"date":"2026-09-21","rank":218,"change":{"